# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT
## Modern Dual-Mode eCommerce & Product Catalogue Platform

### 1. Project Vision

Develop a complete, modern, scalable, SEO-friendly web application that can operate in two distinct modes:

1. **eCommerce Mode:** A fully functional online store where customers can browse products, select variations, add products to their cart, apply discount coupons, select shipping methods, and place orders using Cash on Delivery.

2. **Product Catalogue Mode:** A product presentation platform where customers can browse products, select variations, add products to an inquiry cart, and submit requests for quotations instead of placing orders.

The platform must be managed through one centralized administration dashboard and use a shared product catalogue and database.

The administrator must be able to switch between the two modes through a global platform setting without affecting existing products, customers, orders, inquiries, quotations, or historical records.

The application must have a premium, modern design, excellent user experience, responsive layouts, high performance, and strong technical SEO foundations.

This must be a fully functional application, not just a visual prototype.

