- Styling: Tailwind CSS.
- UI components: Modern reusable component library.
- Authentication: Secure authentication system.
- File storage: Cloud-based image and document storage.
- SEO: Server-side rendering and static generation where appropriate.

Requirements:

- Modular and reusable architecture.
- Responsive frontend.
- Secure API endpoints.
- Database persistence.
- Role-based access control.
- Separation of business logic and presentation.
- Reusable components.
- Scalable database architecture.
- Easy integration of future payment providers and external services.

Use the recommended stack unless the development environment requires a different approach.

